(
    title: "Towering Inferno",
    developer: Some("Paul Allen Newell, Tom Sloper, Jeff Corsiglia"),
    description: Some("Fight up through a burning skyscraper to the window where four survivors wait, hosing flames aside as you climb — then run for the exit passage, which stays sealed until you have them. The survivors dwindle one by one while the clock runs, a wall of fire breaks into smaller flames rather than dying, and nine buildings of nine floors each stand between you and the end."),
